      <Placemark><name>PEI Shellfish Museum (Ellerslie-Bideford)</name><description>[Day 13] Interactive museum celebrating PEI's world-famous Malpeque oyster and shellfish fishery.</description><Point><coordinates>-63.9185,46.6095,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Bideford Parsonage Museum (PEI)</name><description>[Day 13] 19th-century parsonage where L.M. Montgomery boarded as a young teacher in 1894–1895.</description><Point><coordinates>-63.912,46.612,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Green Park Shipbuilding Museum &amp; Yeo House</name><description>[Day 13] Provincial heritage park &amp; 1865 Victorian mansion chronicling PEI's wooden shipbuilding golden age.</description><Point><coordinates>-63.8895,46.5885,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Statue of Leif Erikson (L'Anse aux Meadows)</name><description>[Day 7] Bronze monument to Norse explorer Leif Erikson overlooking the bay where Vikings landed 1,000 years ago.</description><Point><coordinates>-55.527428,51.601456,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Port au Choix National Historic Site</name><description>[Day 8] Ancient Maritime Archaic, Dorset, and Groswater Paleoeskimo burial and settlement grounds on limestone barrens.</description><Point><coordinates>-57.381904,50.697984,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
