      <Placemark><name>Lucy Maud Montgomery Birthplace (New London, PEI)</name><description>[Day 13] 1874 white-shingled cottage at the New London crossroads where L.M. Montgomery was born.</description><Point><coordinates>-63.511257,46.465293,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
