    <Folder><name>HAZARD (15)</name>
      <Placemark><name>Dirt Road Section Starts (Fire Lake Unpaved QC-389)</name><description>[Day 3] ⚠️ Paved highway ends and unpaved gravel road section begins near Fire Lake Mine. Reduce speed to 70–80 km/h and stand on pegs over washboard.</description><Point><coordinates>-67.378378,52.344335,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Dirt Road Stops Here — Pavement Begins (Mont-Wright)</name><description>[Day 3] ✅ Northern end of the Fire Lake–Mont-Wright gravel stretch! Smooth asphalt pavement resumes into Fermont and the Labrador border.</description><Point><coordinates>-67.322654,52.771881,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>🛑 Stop Sign — Before Single-Lane Bridge (QC-389)</name><description>[Day 3] ⚠️ Mandatory stop sign approaching narrow single-lane wilderness bridge on Route 389. Yield to oncoming heavy iron-ore haul trucks.</description><Point><coordinates>-67.413572,52.729326,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
