      <Placemark><name>Camping des Voltigeurs (Sépaq - Drummondville)</name><description>[Day 16] Tranquil riverside Sépaq park along the Saint-François River off A-20. Clean hot showers, quiet wooded campsites, zero city congestion.</description><Point><coordinates>-72.4694,45.8833,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
