    <Folder><name>LIGHTHOUSE (245)</name>
      <Placemark><name>Phare du Moulin-à-Baude (Tadoussac)</name><description>[Day 2] Historic red-and-white coastal beacon perched above the St. Lawrence estuary and Saguenay Fjord confluence; world-class beluga whale lookout.</description><Point><coordinates>-69.6975,48.1542,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Phare de Cap-de-Bon-Désir</name><description>[Day 2] Historic navigational station on granite ledges dropping 300 meters into the St. Lawrence Laurentian Channel; prime shore whale watching.</description><Point><coordinates>-69.467,48.337,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
